@startuml
actor Lecturer
boundary ClientAccountPage
control AccountController
control AccountService
control EmailService
database Database
boundary NotificationService

Lecturer -> ClientAccountPage: Enter client details (name, email)
ClientAccountPage -> AccountController: Submit client details for account creation

AccountController -> AccountService: Request account creation with client details
AccountService -> AccountService: Generate auto-generated password
AccountService -> Database: Save client account with encrypted password
Database --> AccountService: Return save status

alt Account creation successful
    AccountService -> EmailService: Send login credentials to client
    EmailService -> NotificationService: Create email with login details and password
    NotificationService -> ClientEmail: Send email with credentials and instructions
    NotificationService --> EmailService: Return email status
    EmailService --> AccountService: Return email sending status
    AccountService -> AccountController: Confirm successful account creation
    AccountController --> ClientAccountPage: Display success message
else Account creation failed
    AccountService --> AccountController: Return error status
    AccountController --> ClientAccountPage: Display error message
end

Lecturer -> ClientAccountPage: Request to resend login credentials
ClientAccountPage -> AccountController: Request resend of login credentials
AccountController -> AccountService: Regenerate new password and update account
AccountService -> AccountService: Generate new password
AccountService -> AccountService: Hash new password
AccountService -> Database: Update client account with new hashed password
Database --> AccountService: Return update status

AccountService -> EmailService: Send new login credentials to client
EmailService -> NotificationService: Create email with new login details and password
NotificationService -> ClientEmail: Send email with new credentials and instructions
NotificationService --> EmailService: Return email status
EmailService --> AccountService: Return email sending status
AccountService -> AccountController: Confirm resend of credentials
AccountController --> ClientAccountPage: Display resend confirmation

@enduml